# Release signing keys. Losing one means never being able to update the app
# under the same identity again; leaking one lets anyone ship a forged update.
# Prefer keeping the .jks entirely OUTSIDE the repo and pointing at it with an
# absolute path in local.properties — then no gitignore edit can ever expose it.
*.jks
*.keystore

# Vendored sherpa-onnx wake-word AAR (28 MB) — fetched from its pinned GitHub
# release by the config-time guard in app/build.gradle.kts. Kept out of git
# history on purpose (large binary). The 5 MB int8 KWS model under
# app/src/main/assets/kws/ IS committed — it is product runtime data.
/app/libs/*.aar
